+	 * (dump_mem_sz = size - console - ftrace - pmsg), divided into
+	 * record-size chunks: 0x100000 - 0x40000 - 0x8000 = 0xB8000, and
+	 * 0xB8000 / 0x8000 = 23 exactly.  Twenty-three retained oops/panic
